      "description": "Watch Real Madrid vs Malaga highlights and goals from La Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 30, 2026. The Santiago Bernabéu played host to a high-stakes La Liga clash on August 30, 2026, as Real Madrid looked to maintain their momentum against a resilient Malaga side eager to prove their worth on the big stage. A Commanding Start for the Hosts Real Madrid established their dominance early on, pinning the visitors back with relentless attacking play. The breakthrough arrived in the 19th minute when Jude Bellingham found the bottom corner with a precise right-footed strike. Although the goal was subject to a lengthy VAR review, the referee eventually pointed to the center spot. The lead was doubled just seven minutes later under fortuitous circumstances; after Bellingham's initial effort was hacked off the line, the ball rebounded off goalkeeper Alfonso Herrero and into the net for an own goal. Mbappe's Brilliance and Malaga's Response The pressure didn't let up, and the home fans were treated to a moment of magic in the 30th minute. Trent Alexander-Arnold delivered a pinpoint cross that was met by Kylian Mbappe , who executed a stunning right-footed volley to make it 3-0. Malaga desperately searched for a lifeline before the interval and came agonizingly close in the 42nd minute when Rafa Rodriguez saw his powerful effort crash against the post, much to the relief of the Madrid faithful. VAR Drama and the Super Sub's Final Word The second half saw both sides strike the woodwork, with Bellingham hitting the post in the 55th minute as he searched for a second. The match took a dramatic turn in the 85th minute when the referee initially awarded Malaga a penalty for a foul by Yan Diomande . However, following a VAR intervention, the decision was overturned. The spotlight then shifted to Arda Guler , who entered the fray as a late substitute. In the 91st minute, the Turkish youngster latched onto an assist from Vinicius 